{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 23, :comments ["<b>Two cubits its length, etc.</b> Now when you combine all the cubits of the table — one cubit by one cubit in height one cubit — there will be, between length and width and height, three cubits squared in length and width and height. And this is the sod of the influx of the supernal table from three gradations in Netzach, Hod, Yesod, of the world."], :book :exodus, :voice :or-hachaim, :lang :en, :chapter 25, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T19:33:22.812181324Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}